WEBVTT

01:25.040 --> 01:28.000
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:42.280 --> 01:43.280
Duanwu.

01:45.720 --> 01:48.280
I wonder if your lady
likes gold accessories.

01:48.800 --> 01:52.080
If she does, we could create
a gold-inlaid jade piece,

01:52.160 --> 01:53.520
a brand-new design.

01:54.360 --> 01:57.840
But if you want it flawless,
that won't be possible.

01:58.520 --> 02:00.200
My lady does like gold accessories.

02:00.720 --> 02:03.640
As long as you can fix it,
adding some gold is no issue.

02:04.240 --> 02:05.800
Are you sure you can fix it?

02:11.039 --> 02:12.040
Fix it according to this design.

02:21.320 --> 02:23.480
-Duanwu, the heat's just right.
-Good.

02:25.920 --> 02:27.120
Be careful.

02:43.440 --> 02:45.600
This clasp needs to be a bit smaller.

02:46.120 --> 02:48.160
Right here, it must be smaller.

02:48.240 --> 02:49.840
-Fill in this seam.
-Mm, okay.

02:54.600 --> 02:56.520
Who's crowding
around the Zheng' Mansion gate?

02:59.000 --> 03:00.280
Oh, you're here, Jin Xian.

03:01.000 --> 03:03.960
I specially invited the two of them
to repair Lady Yu's bracelet.

03:06.120 --> 03:07.920
Zheng family has their own Jubao House,

03:08.000 --> 03:10.320
so why trouble outsiders?

03:10.400 --> 03:12.320
Can't you get them to work?

03:15.520 --> 03:18.880
With this spare time,
you should focus on your own household.

03:18.960 --> 03:20.480
With such a sharp tongue,

03:20.560 --> 03:21.840
you should go comfort
your lady more often.

03:25.560 --> 03:28.640
What nerve you have?
How dare you speak ill of our lady!

03:30.040 --> 03:32.920
-I didn't.
-I advise you to tone down the arrogance.

03:33.000 --> 03:35.400
The lady and concubines
each have their place.

03:35.480 --> 03:38.000
We Zhengs aren't one
of those unruly families.

03:38.680 --> 03:40.400
All will be revealed in time.

03:44.040 --> 03:45.360
What's with blocking the doorway?

03:45.440 --> 03:47.040
Once you're done, leave quickly.

03:53.080 --> 03:55.800
Bah! Let's see how long your pride lasts!

03:58.040 --> 04:01.400
Miss, who was that just now?

04:01.480 --> 04:03.720
What's it to you?
Go back to fixing the bracelet!

04:03.800 --> 04:05.640
We've caused you trouble.

04:06.160 --> 04:08.960
We're new here,
afraid we might break some taboos,

04:09.040 --> 04:11.440
so we asked a bit more
just because of that.

04:12.080 --> 04:13.480
No harm in telling you.

04:14.000 --> 04:16.760
She's the maid
of the primary wife, Lady Cui.

04:16.839 --> 04:18.640
Her name is Jin Xian.

04:20.720 --> 04:22.360
The Cui family in Zhenlang Pavilion?

04:23.120 --> 04:24.080
Who else would it be?

04:24.840 --> 04:28.240
But now that the Cui family has fallen,
let's see how long her pride lasts.

04:30.880 --> 04:32.920
What are you standing around for?
Get back to fixing that bracelet!

04:33.000 --> 04:34.960
-I've been waiting forever.
-Almost done.

04:36.920 --> 04:37.880
It's finished.

04:40.880 --> 04:42.160
-Here you are, Miss Zhegu.
-Miss, take a look.

04:42.240 --> 04:43.520
Is it to your liking?

04:53.880 --> 04:55.200
You do have some skill.

04:56.760 --> 04:58.160
Thank you, Miss Zhegu.

04:59.200 --> 05:00.600
How do you know my name?

05:01.840 --> 05:03.000
I heard

05:03.080 --> 05:06.720
that you're Lady Yu's most trusted aide
and also quite beautiful.

05:06.800 --> 05:09.520
Seeing you today,
you truly are extraordinary.

05:14.760 --> 05:17.600
Miss, which pair of earrings
did you fancy just now?

05:20.960 --> 05:22.320
This one.

05:22.400 --> 05:23.720
Our Miss does have an eye for these.

05:23.800 --> 05:24.640
Miss Zhegu,

05:24.720 --> 05:27.640
these earrings
are the finest we've ever made,

05:28.240 --> 05:29.680
and they suit you perfectly.

05:32.760 --> 05:33.600
Very well.

05:33.680 --> 05:36.040
We heard that the Qionghua Festival
is coming soon.

05:36.120 --> 05:37.800
Could you put in a good word for us?

05:39.080 --> 05:41.400
Of course, we wouldn't dare
to aim for those famed songstresses,

05:41.480 --> 05:46.120
but maybe their maids
could take a liking to our jewelry.

05:47.480 --> 05:49.760
Don't push your luck too far.

05:54.720 --> 05:59.880
We're only being bold
because you seem so kind.

05:59.960 --> 06:01.560
It's our first time in Yangzhou,

06:01.640 --> 06:03.120
and it hasn't been easy.

06:04.080 --> 06:08.280
Please say a few good words to Lady Yu
on our behalf.

06:12.840 --> 06:13.720
Hey…

06:15.000 --> 06:16.160
Thank you, Miss.

06:18.200 --> 06:20.720
Alright. You may leave for now.

06:20.800 --> 06:22.480
I'll first report to Lady Yu.

06:23.480 --> 06:25.200
-Thank you, Miss.
-Thank you, Miss.

06:41.960 --> 06:43.720
My lady, look!

06:51.720 --> 06:55.080
Those self-important old folks
at Jubao House

06:55.160 --> 06:57.320
can only make
old-fashioned gold-inlaid jade.

06:58.480 --> 06:59.920
This can't be their handiwork.

07:00.000 --> 07:01.080
You have a sharp eye, my lady.

07:01.160 --> 07:02.600
There are two girls at the back door,

07:02.680 --> 07:04.360
specializing in selling
and repairing jewelry.

07:04.440 --> 07:05.280
They made this piece.

07:06.200 --> 07:08.360
-What did they charge?
-They didn't ask for money.

07:09.280 --> 07:10.800
They only wanted to use your name

07:10.880 --> 07:13.120
to connect with some
of the songstresses' maids,

07:13.200 --> 07:14.720
so they could sell a few trinkets.

07:17.200 --> 07:18.920
Clever plan, indeed.

07:20.040 --> 07:21.800
At least they know their place.

07:22.840 --> 07:24.800
Let's see what kind of people they are.

07:24.880 --> 07:27.640
If they're decent,
I'll place them in Jubao House

07:27.720 --> 07:29.440
to be Fifth Young Master's eyes.

07:29.520 --> 07:31.880
Those old ones won't dare act against him.

07:31.960 --> 07:33.400
Smart thinking, my lady.

07:35.160 --> 07:36.640
What's Fifth Young Master
been up to lately?

07:36.720 --> 07:38.480
Why haven't I seen him around?

07:39.520 --> 07:43.320
I heard he's been
with Lady Shijiu from the Cui family…

07:43.400 --> 07:44.440
Enough of that!

07:47.000 --> 07:49.640
He and Shijiu grew up together.

07:49.720 --> 07:50.560
Remember,

07:51.600 --> 07:53.560
they're like brother and sister.

07:53.640 --> 07:55.960
The Cui family fell on hard times,
so he's just helping her out.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.200
Understood.

07:57.800 --> 07:59.640
-Off you go.
-Yes, Ma'am.

08:07.080 --> 08:08.640
Oh, Fifth Young Master,

08:09.240 --> 08:11.800
don't you dare do anything foolish.

08:26.680 --> 08:27.680
Lady Shijiu,

08:27.760 --> 08:29.360
look who's here.

08:35.840 --> 08:36.960
Master Shijiu!

08:37.039 --> 08:39.000
Lady Shijiu!

08:39.080 --> 08:40.960
Tong! Tan!

08:41.039 --> 08:41.880
Master Shijiu!

08:41.960 --> 08:43.159
-Lady Shijiu!
-Tan!

08:43.240 --> 08:44.720
-Master Shijiu!
-Lady Shijiu!

08:46.080 --> 08:48.840
-Master Shijiu!
-Lady Shijiu!

08:52.600 --> 08:53.960
-Are you all right?
-I'm fine.

08:54.040 --> 08:55.480
-Are you all right?
-Master Shijiu…

08:55.560 --> 08:59.480
Lady Shijiu, forgive me!

08:59.560 --> 09:01.240
Lady Shijiu!

09:01.320 --> 09:03.520
-Lady Shijiu!
-Get up!

09:03.600 --> 09:06.000
Forgive me, Lady Shijiu!

09:08.080 --> 09:10.160
Those bandits were closing in on us.

09:10.240 --> 09:13.720
Tan and I had no other choice
but to push you down.

09:14.520 --> 09:16.640
I understand.

09:17.280 --> 09:18.360
How…

09:18.440 --> 09:21.040
-How did you end up so badly?
-Lady Shijiu, you don't know.

09:21.120 --> 09:23.400
Those bandits wouldn't let up.

09:23.480 --> 09:24.560
I ran for days,

09:24.640 --> 09:26.640
finally got out of the forest
and into town.

09:26.720 --> 09:29.160
After that, I could only beg for food.

09:30.880 --> 09:33.920
Fortunately… Mr. Zheng saved us.

09:36.800 --> 09:40.360
-Master Shijiu, I've missed you deeply…
-All right.

09:40.440 --> 09:42.760
Tong and Tan
must have gone days without food.

09:42.840 --> 09:45.080
Let's get them something good to eat.
Clean yourselves up.

09:45.760 --> 09:47.680
This courtyard is empty most of the time.

09:48.200 --> 09:50.880
If you don't mind, you can stay here.

09:52.240 --> 09:55.200
-Garuda, arrange it.
-Yes, sir.

09:57.840 --> 09:58.880
Thank you.

10:03.800 --> 10:06.120
We've been friends since we were kids.
No need for thanks.

10:07.320 --> 10:08.600
It's getting late.

10:09.400 --> 10:10.520
Get some rest.

10:14.000 --> 10:15.520
Lady Shijiu…

10:17.760 --> 10:20.640
-Lady Shijiu…
-Get up, quickly!

10:25.680 --> 10:26.680
Lady Shijiu,

10:27.640 --> 10:29.520
now that the master is gone,

10:30.480 --> 10:32.520
what are we going to do?

10:37.080 --> 10:38.280
You still have me.

10:40.760 --> 10:44.720
We are always in the same boat.

10:50.200 --> 10:52.440
But I'll need you
to help me with something.

11:49.440 --> 11:50.520
Who is it?

12:06.760 --> 12:09.000
Lady Shijiu…

12:10.880 --> 12:11.720
You…

12:56.440 --> 12:57.840
Lady Shijiu…

12:59.160 --> 13:01.760
It's so late. You…

13:59.480 --> 14:00.680
Master Shijiu,

14:02.040 --> 14:03.240
I'm sorry.

14:04.400 --> 14:06.400
I must avenge the Cui family,

14:08.120 --> 14:09.840
no matter the cost.

14:17.680 --> 14:20.040
Most of the jewelry shops in Yangzhou

14:20.560 --> 14:22.360
are now under Zheng's control.

14:23.560 --> 14:27.200
If we want to find an opening,
we must start with the Qionghua Festival.

14:27.280 --> 14:31.480
If we stand out at the Qionghua Festival,
it'll bring a handsome profit.

14:32.840 --> 14:33.720
However,

14:33.800 --> 14:37.360
all the famous songstresses in Yangzhou
have powerful backers.

14:39.720 --> 14:41.800
Each of them is driven by self-interest.

14:42.560 --> 14:44.280
No one can resist the lure of money.

14:52.320 --> 14:54.120
Keep yesterday's jewelry for me.

14:54.640 --> 14:55.560
I'll make use of it.

14:56.400 --> 14:57.400
All right.

14:58.800 --> 15:00.560
Miss, let me peel an orange for you.

15:01.560 --> 15:03.000
Does this look nice?

15:03.080 --> 15:05.040
I think the one you had earlier
looked better.

15:05.120 --> 15:07.000
-Really?
-It should be a bit greener.

15:07.080 --> 15:08.280
It looks good.

15:10.440 --> 15:12.040
But it doesn't quite match
my outfit today.

15:12.120 --> 15:13.320
Look at this color.

15:17.600 --> 15:19.000
You haven't visited in so long.

15:19.520 --> 15:21.680
Without your help,

15:21.760 --> 15:24.160
Lady Bai can't pick jewelry
she likes herself.

15:24.240 --> 15:27.120
I've been so busy lately,
handling various matters.

15:29.080 --> 15:30.160
Lady Yu, please, have a seat.

15:31.600 --> 15:33.920
It's a rare pleasure
to have you here at Baicaojing House.

15:34.000 --> 15:36.320
Today, you must lend me
your discerning eye.

15:41.480 --> 15:43.080
Zhegu, stay nearby.

15:43.160 --> 15:44.160
Yes, Ma'am.

15:53.440 --> 15:54.680
Why did she leave so quickly?

15:54.760 --> 15:56.240
Surely Baicaojing House
has some new treasures.

15:56.320 --> 15:57.360
Greetings, Miss Zhegu.

15:57.880 --> 15:59.200
As if we could afford anything here.

15:59.280 --> 16:00.920
-Yours is quite lovely.
-We'll just admire this one.

16:01.000 --> 16:01.840
Let me try it on.

16:01.920 --> 16:03.920
Miss, is there anything you like?

16:04.000 --> 16:06.640
I feel what the Zheng family
gave me is enough.

16:07.560 --> 16:08.960
-I'll take this one.
-Or maybe…

16:09.040 --> 16:10.760
-This one is like Lady Bai's.
-I'll buy it, so you can wear it later.

16:10.840 --> 16:11.920
-Then I want the pink one.
-With my natural beauty,

16:12.000 --> 16:13.000
-I don't even need it!
-Look at them.

16:13.080 --> 16:14.480
Baicaojing House's goods
are simply the best.

16:15.080 --> 16:16.080
Indeed.

16:24.680 --> 16:26.920
Thank you, Miss Zhegu,
for bringing us here today.

16:35.560 --> 16:36.400
Miss,

16:38.240 --> 16:41.000
look at our new mother-of-pearl jewelry,

16:41.080 --> 16:42.600
Miss Zhegu's favorite.

16:43.120 --> 16:44.160
So beautiful!

16:44.680 --> 16:47.240
Such shallow taste, you haven't seen
quality things, I suppose.

16:47.320 --> 16:49.960
Compared to Baicaojing House,
they're still far off.

16:53.200 --> 16:56.080
Miss Zhegu, who are they?

16:57.400 --> 17:00.800
The one on the left is Yan Fenfen,
always second place.

17:00.880 --> 17:03.640
Every day, she's scheming
to compete with Lady Bai.

17:04.240 --> 17:07.359
The one with the flower in her hair
is Xue Liniang.

17:08.160 --> 17:10.400
She's straightforward by nature

17:10.480 --> 17:14.280
and the youngest among the songstresses,
so naturally, she's rising fast.

17:14.359 --> 17:16.640
So, Xue Liniang
should be in the top three, right?

17:17.240 --> 17:18.319
Top three?

17:19.400 --> 17:22.680
She only gained popularity this year,
not even ranked yet.

17:22.760 --> 17:24.839
But this year,
with the Zheng family backing her,

17:24.920 --> 17:27.640
who knows who will win
the top beauty title?

17:29.200 --> 17:30.760
Miss Zhegu, you're quite the expert.

17:33.120 --> 17:36.120
-Do you like these two?
-Why hasn't Lady Yu come out yet?

17:36.720 --> 17:38.760
Isn't the Zheng family
supporting you this time?

17:38.840 --> 17:39.680
Yes.

17:40.520 --> 17:42.640
But why is she talking
with Lady Bai for so long?

17:44.840 --> 17:47.960
-Do you think something's changed?
-How could that be?

17:48.040 --> 17:50.840
Yesterday, they brought over
the jewelry for me to choose from,

17:50.920 --> 17:52.880
all top-notch pieces.

17:54.800 --> 17:58.240
Liniang,
with the Zheng family behind you now,

17:58.760 --> 18:01.320
Lady Yu will surely give you some favor.

18:01.920 --> 18:04.280
Still, you should be cautious.

18:04.360 --> 18:05.360
Don't be too naive.

18:05.440 --> 18:09.520
Otherwise, someone scheming
might steal your good fortune.

18:13.920 --> 18:18.280
These jewels are indeed fine,
worthy of Lady Bai.

18:19.680 --> 18:22.920
But why would I need to appraise them?

18:23.720 --> 18:24.640
Please.

18:26.360 --> 18:27.640
It's rare to have your esteemed presence.

18:27.720 --> 18:29.800
A chance to chat with you

18:29.880 --> 18:32.360
is worth more
than a thousand clever tricks.

18:32.880 --> 18:33.800
Absolutely.

18:33.880 --> 18:36.080
Just listening from the side,
I've learned a lot.

18:39.560 --> 18:40.720
The Qionghua Festival is near.

18:41.520 --> 18:44.520
In previous years,
the guild lead hosted it personally.

18:44.600 --> 18:47.400
I wonder if that's
still the case this year.

18:49.200 --> 18:51.720
Our master is humble and low-key,

18:51.800 --> 18:53.960
unlike Mr. Cui, who loves the spotlight.

18:54.560 --> 18:57.840
So, all these bothersome matters
fall on me.

18:57.920 --> 18:59.480
I'm so busy.

19:01.880 --> 19:04.080
No one would be more fitting
to host it than you.

19:04.680 --> 19:08.240
The people of Yangzhou
still admire your charm from back then.

19:09.760 --> 19:12.400
Mr. Zheng just took the seat this year.

19:12.920 --> 19:16.280
If you could help Jubao House
produce a top beauty,

19:16.360 --> 19:17.520
wouldn't it be perfect?

19:17.600 --> 19:19.760
A cherry on top, even.

19:19.840 --> 19:23.680
Speaking of the top beauty title,
Lady Bai has won it two years in a row.

19:24.320 --> 19:28.400
This year,
if your Zheng family joins forces

19:28.480 --> 19:30.400
with my Baicaojing House,

19:30.480 --> 19:33.280
why worry about winning three in a row?

19:34.520 --> 19:37.920
How could I take the one
Baicaojing House has backed?

19:39.360 --> 19:40.480
What are you saying?

19:40.560 --> 19:43.560
We're joining forces. It's not poaching.

19:45.960 --> 19:48.320
I appreciate your good intentions,

19:48.960 --> 19:51.120
but the Zheng family's journey
is just beginning.

19:51.200 --> 19:52.680
If we're supporting someone,
it'll be a younger talent.

19:53.280 --> 19:54.920
Xue Liniang would be a fine choice.

19:56.040 --> 20:00.200
Miss Xue is indeed promising.

20:01.920 --> 20:03.240
But…

20:04.840 --> 20:07.000
she's young and impulsive.

20:07.080 --> 20:09.400
She may not handle
big responsibilities well.

20:11.080 --> 20:15.080
You have a keener eye than Mr. Zheng.

20:17.560 --> 20:18.560
You're kidding!

20:18.640 --> 20:21.320
How could I compare myself
to the guild lead?

20:23.920 --> 20:27.200
Backing one or two makes no difference.

20:28.080 --> 20:29.280
There's no conflict.

20:36.600 --> 20:38.040
I heard

20:39.040 --> 20:42.080
Miss Xue was recommended by Mr. Si.

20:47.080 --> 20:50.160
Both Si and Wu are Zheng family men,

20:51.080 --> 20:53.520
wholeheartedly for the Zheng family.

20:57.120 --> 20:58.280
Of course.

20:59.320 --> 21:02.120
Both are outstanding individuals,

21:02.200 --> 21:04.320
trusted deeply by Mr. Zheng.

21:04.400 --> 21:07.480
The Zheng family prospers
with capable heirs to follow.

21:13.320 --> 21:14.480
Miss Zhegu,

21:15.400 --> 21:17.200
may I ask
if all the songstresses here today

21:17.280 --> 21:18.360
are attending the Qionghua Festival?

21:18.440 --> 21:20.960
Of course, who do you think?

21:23.080 --> 21:24.440
Only Lady Huan didn't show.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.360
Lady Huan?

21:29.360 --> 21:30.880
Why didn't she come?

21:31.400 --> 21:33.280
With that pride of hers,

21:33.360 --> 21:35.800
even if invited, she wouldn't come.

21:35.880 --> 21:39.360
Maybe she doesn't want to be
a living sign for Baicaojing House.

21:39.440 --> 21:42.680
With Lady Bai around,
who needs her as a sign?

21:42.760 --> 21:46.760
She lost to Lady Bai two years ago
and didn't even show up last year.

21:47.600 --> 21:50.840
If she didn't come last year,
why come this year?

21:50.920 --> 21:52.600
Who knows?

21:52.680 --> 21:54.360
Maybe she's plotting something.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.720
And you'd know, would you?

21:55.800 --> 21:59.400
After all, Lady Huan
was once a famous songstress,

22:00.120 --> 22:03.320
and now there's a tough rival.

22:03.400 --> 22:05.520
Someone might lose sleep over it.

22:05.600 --> 22:07.800
The Huan family relied
on the Cui family for business.

22:07.880 --> 22:10.680
Now that the Cui family has fallen,
what do they have to live on?

22:10.760 --> 22:13.040
So, the Huan family will step back?
How come I didn't know?

22:13.120 --> 22:14.560
With your humble family background,
you know nothing.

22:14.640 --> 22:17.520
-I…
-Miss Zhegu, born of a noble family,

22:17.600 --> 22:19.040
you truly know more than the rest of us.

22:19.120 --> 22:21.120
How are your preparations
for the Qionghua Festival?

22:21.200 --> 22:22.440
Have you practiced enough?

22:23.360 --> 22:24.600
Lady Yu is here!

22:25.120 --> 22:26.560
Lady Yu has arrived.

22:29.680 --> 22:31.520
The Qionghua Festival is near.

22:31.600 --> 22:33.160
All of you should practice diligently,

22:33.240 --> 22:34.960
and don't indulge in comfort.

22:35.040 --> 22:37.040
Only then will you honor
the hardships of your training.

22:37.120 --> 22:38.480
Yes, Ma'am.

22:40.560 --> 22:43.840
Miss Xue, mind your posture.

22:43.920 --> 22:45.080
Learn more from Lady Bai.

22:46.120 --> 22:47.520
If you don't perfect this dance,

22:47.600 --> 22:49.120
the Zheng family
can replace you at any time.

22:49.200 --> 22:53.400
Our Zheng family supports only the best.

22:56.280 --> 22:57.680
-Yes, Ma'am.
-Zhegu.

22:57.760 --> 22:58.920
-Here!
-Let's go.

22:59.000 --> 23:00.040
Step aside.

23:13.880 --> 23:17.320
Lady Bai, don't be angry. I…

23:29.080 --> 23:30.600
Su Muzhe greets Lady Bai.

23:30.680 --> 23:33.440
This Su Muzhe came with Lady Yu.

23:38.360 --> 23:39.440
Are you from the Zheng family?

23:39.520 --> 23:41.240
To answer Lady Bai,

23:41.760 --> 23:43.480
I am not from the Zheng family,

23:44.360 --> 23:48.040
but our jewelry has caught Lady Yu's eye,

23:48.560 --> 23:52.080
which brought us here to Baicaojing House
for a visit.

23:52.160 --> 23:55.640
Lady Yu is not easy to please.

23:57.360 --> 23:59.160
What skill do you have to earn her favor?

24:02.320 --> 24:03.400
Lady Bai, look.

24:03.480 --> 24:05.640
The jewelry we crafted

24:06.240 --> 24:08.560
is quite different
from what's found in Yangzhou.

24:13.120 --> 24:15.400
I've heard your pipa playing
is famous far and wide,

24:16.400 --> 24:21.000
but at the Qionghua Festival,
other songstresses play equally well.

24:22.600 --> 24:24.040
If you wore

24:24.120 --> 24:26.880
these mother-of-pearl
press-on nails while playing,

24:27.400 --> 24:30.560
you would surely shine at the festival.

24:32.120 --> 24:36.360
Typically, mother-of-pearl
is used on dowries or large items.

24:37.200 --> 24:38.880
But you defy convention,

24:39.480 --> 24:41.240
using it on such a small press-on nail.

24:41.320 --> 24:44.320
The craftsmanship is exquisite,
and the thought behind it is clever.

24:47.840 --> 24:49.640
So, your response?

24:51.640 --> 24:53.960
Lady Bai, if you wish
to win the top beauty title,

24:54.480 --> 24:56.520
Zhenlang Pavilion
is willing to support you fully.

24:59.000 --> 24:59.880
Zhenlang Pavilion?

25:00.640 --> 25:04.200
Is it you who's replacing the Cui family?

25:05.760 --> 25:06.800
Exactly.

25:09.920 --> 25:12.960
But hoping to win
Yangzhou's top beauty title

25:13.880 --> 25:15.840
with just ten press-on nails

25:15.920 --> 25:17.400
is rather naive.

25:22.080 --> 25:24.120
Consider this a token of introduction
from Zhenlang Pavilion,

25:24.200 --> 25:25.320
a small gesture.

25:30.280 --> 25:31.600
Lady Bai…

25:37.920 --> 25:39.480
Lady Bai, I'm awaiting your response.

25:42.040 --> 25:44.840
Miss Su,
while the mother-of-pearl is exquisite,

25:45.360 --> 25:47.280
it still can't match
Zhenlang Pavilion's influence.

25:48.080 --> 25:49.080
Apologies.

25:58.000 --> 26:01.280
GRACIOUS COURTYARD OF ORCHIDS AND JADE

26:02.960 --> 26:03.960
Serve tea.

26:07.840 --> 26:10.320
-Master Yan, please, have a seat.
-No need.

26:11.480 --> 26:14.720
I want you to win the Qionghua Festival,
no matter the cost.

26:25.360 --> 26:26.320
Certainly.

26:26.400 --> 26:28.760
You're welcome to choose
from any of Zhenlang Pavilion's jewels.

26:30.520 --> 26:32.080
Thank you for your generosity, Master.

26:33.720 --> 26:37.280
Master Yan, I will do my utmost.

26:37.920 --> 26:40.240
But I do have a small request.

26:40.320 --> 26:43.400
I'm fond of Baicaojing House,

26:43.480 --> 26:45.520
-so I wonder if you could--
-Of course.

26:46.920 --> 26:48.840
I'll look after Baicaojing House.

26:49.760 --> 26:52.320
After all, it was founded
by your younger brother.

26:56.800 --> 26:57.760
Master Yan…

27:19.120 --> 27:21.040
Duanwu, how did it go?

27:25.240 --> 27:27.040
Shall we look elsewhere?

27:27.120 --> 27:28.760
I saw plenty of songstresses earlier.

27:36.040 --> 27:37.000
Yunxiu,

27:38.200 --> 27:40.360
do you recall them mentioning

27:41.440 --> 27:42.360
Lady Huan?

27:43.920 --> 27:44.960
Lady Huan?

27:48.800 --> 27:51.800
Women are so short-sighted, selling
themselves out for a set of jewels.

27:51.880 --> 27:54.960
You saw Lady Yu's attitude toward us.

27:55.040 --> 27:57.400
There's no way she'd turn
to our Baicaojing House.

27:57.480 --> 27:59.160
I just don't understand it.

27:59.680 --> 28:01.200
How is Xue Liniang any better than you?

28:05.400 --> 28:07.840
If Lady Yu is out of reach,
let's aim for Zheng Wu instead.

28:08.800 --> 28:10.760
After all, no cat can resist the fish.

28:10.840 --> 28:12.360
Invite him out for drinks a few times,

28:12.440 --> 28:14.960
then, once he's had enough, you--

28:15.040 --> 28:17.520
What are you talking about?
I'm your elder sister!

28:17.600 --> 28:20.080
Clearly, the older you get,
the more sensitive you become.

28:23.280 --> 28:25.440
I can work with Yan Zijing.

28:26.560 --> 28:28.400
Even if he doesn't approach me,

28:28.480 --> 28:30.360
I'll find a way to get close to him.

28:31.080 --> 28:32.160
Why?

28:32.240 --> 28:34.840
Don't ask. Just focus
on managing Baicaojing House.

28:34.920 --> 28:36.200
I will pave the way for you.

28:38.040 --> 28:39.400
Fine, I'll do as you say.

28:42.640 --> 28:44.000
Yan Zijing…

28:51.920 --> 28:54.200
Madam, Mr. Zheng has arrived.

28:54.280 --> 28:56.600
Mom. You were looking for me?

28:57.200 --> 28:59.800
You're never home.
Can't I call on you without reason?

29:01.920 --> 29:04.160
Mom, I brought you
some honey jujube cakes.

29:04.240 --> 29:05.200
They're from Yichun Teahouse.

29:08.880 --> 29:10.960
Don't think I don't know
where you've been.

29:11.040 --> 29:13.800
Yichun Teahouse is in the other courtyard.
What were you doing there?

29:15.200 --> 29:17.840
-Mom…
-Stand straight!

29:17.920 --> 29:19.720
Wipe that grin off your face. Turn around.

29:19.800 --> 29:21.440
I'm not a child anymore.

29:23.120 --> 29:25.600
Cui Shijiu is the legitimate daughter
of the Cui family.

29:25.680 --> 29:27.480
Marrying her was a great advantage before.

29:27.560 --> 29:31.080
But now that the Cui family has fallen,
she's nothing but a burden to you.

29:33.240 --> 29:37.680
With the lady's influence waning,
this is the perfect opportunity for us.

29:38.280 --> 29:41.160
Or do you want to remain
a concubine's son forever?

29:46.360 --> 29:50.480
Don't forget,
the lady is Cui Shijiu's own aunt,

29:50.560 --> 29:52.640
and Zheng Si is her cousin.

29:52.720 --> 29:54.640
Be careful not to let this woman ruin you.

29:56.200 --> 29:59.360
Mom, don't worry. I know what I'm doing.

30:05.560 --> 30:07.600
What were you doing last night?
Didn't sleep well?

30:08.360 --> 30:09.600
Tell me the truth.

30:09.680 --> 30:11.800
I slept just fine, really.

30:22.360 --> 30:24.200
-The Qionghua Festival is approaching…
-Here,

30:24.280 --> 30:25.840
-have some tea, Mom.
-Zheng Zhiheng, listen to me!

30:25.920 --> 30:28.440
Be cautious with the Jubao House.

30:28.520 --> 30:30.720
Watch out for Zheng Si's schemes
behind your back.

30:33.480 --> 30:36.560
By the way,
I recently found a suitable candidate,

30:36.640 --> 30:38.040
quite skilled.

30:38.120 --> 30:41.320
I'm planning to place her in Jubao House
as an informant for you,

30:41.400 --> 30:44.360
so those old folks won't disrespect you.

30:44.440 --> 30:46.160
Take some time to check her out.

30:48.640 --> 30:51.760
If she has your approval,
her skills must be top-notch.

30:55.400 --> 30:57.480
Sachets and pouches…

30:57.560 --> 30:58.520
Move on.

30:59.040 --> 30:59.880
Have a look!

31:02.200 --> 31:04.360
Weren't they supposed to bring me jewelry?

31:04.440 --> 31:05.760
Why haven't they arrived?

31:06.960 --> 31:09.560
-Are they playing me?
-Who's playing you?

31:10.320 --> 31:12.840
Mr. Zheng. No one.

31:26.360 --> 31:27.200
Where did you get this?

31:29.600 --> 31:30.640
It's…

31:31.160 --> 31:32.440
It's from Miss Su.

31:39.520 --> 31:42.320
Is she the craftsman my mom recently met?

31:42.400 --> 31:43.240
It's her.

31:45.600 --> 31:48.480
-What's her name?
-She's called Su Muzhe,

31:48.560 --> 31:49.760
just a little peddler.

31:53.640 --> 31:54.480
Where does she live?

31:54.560 --> 31:57.760
YUNSHENG INN

32:00.400 --> 32:03.760
Sir, Su Muzhe isn't here.
They say she went on business.

32:05.760 --> 32:06.920
Business?

32:10.960 --> 32:12.120
Quite capable.

32:14.000 --> 32:14.840
Let's go.

32:22.320 --> 32:23.440
Zheng Wu?

32:40.480 --> 32:42.920
Yunxiu, you should head back first.

32:44.240 --> 32:45.240
All right.

33:02.360 --> 33:04.560
So, you are Su Muzhe,

33:04.640 --> 33:08.480
the little peddler
who dares to target my mother?

33:16.400 --> 33:17.520
In Yangzhou,

33:17.600 --> 33:21.400
it's my first time
waiting for someone like this.

33:21.480 --> 33:23.480
Greetings, Mr. Zheng.

33:25.200 --> 33:28.040
Had I known you were waiting,

33:28.840 --> 33:30.000
I'd have returned sooner.

33:39.320 --> 33:40.520
Every year,

33:40.600 --> 33:44.440
countless people try to ally
with the Zheng family.

33:44.960 --> 33:48.560
I've seen too many like you.

33:52.000 --> 33:55.200
Well, since my mother recommended you,

33:55.720 --> 33:58.600
there's an opening in Jubao House.

33:59.240 --> 34:01.320
Let's see what you're capable of.

34:02.720 --> 34:04.040
Thank Lady Yu for the opportunity,

34:06.320 --> 34:07.800
and thank you for the recognition.

34:07.880 --> 34:09.560
But with the Qionghua Festival near,

34:10.080 --> 34:12.760
I ask you to return in a month.

34:12.840 --> 34:15.600
By then, you will certainly offer
a higher bid.

34:15.679 --> 34:19.600
The Qionghua Festival has always been
the domain of the jewelry families.

34:20.719 --> 34:21.600
You,

34:21.679 --> 34:24.360
a newcomer peddler in Yangzhou,

34:24.880 --> 34:26.800
what can you pull off?

34:26.880 --> 34:28.760
What can I pull off?

34:30.880 --> 34:31.840
Just wait and see.

34:36.880 --> 34:37.920
Fine!

34:38.639 --> 34:39.760
Let's wait and see.

34:51.560 --> 34:53.320
Lady Huan, come down!

34:54.320 --> 34:55.520
Lady Huan!

35:00.880 --> 35:01.920
Be careful!

35:02.000 --> 35:04.120
Come and take a look.

35:05.760 --> 35:06.800
Lady Huan…

35:07.520 --> 35:08.800
Look.

35:11.160 --> 35:12.480
Be careful!

35:12.560 --> 35:13.720
-Please come down…
-Who is that?

35:13.800 --> 35:14.640
That's Lady Huan.

35:14.720 --> 35:16.800
-What if you fall into the water?
-She acts like that every day.

35:18.320 --> 35:20.040
-Lady Huan…
-These songstresses,

35:20.120 --> 35:21.400
-each has her own way.
-Lady Huan…

35:21.480 --> 35:23.080
-Just showing off.
-I beg you, come down!

35:23.160 --> 35:24.000
Exactly.

35:24.080 --> 35:25.560
Probably, she's abandoned
by the Huan family.

35:25.640 --> 35:26.920
That's too risky!

35:29.520 --> 35:32.080
Lady Huan, please come down.

35:32.600 --> 35:34.640
Be careful not to fall into the water.

35:34.720 --> 35:36.680
So what if I fall?

35:38.120 --> 35:39.760
So what if I live or die?

35:39.840 --> 35:41.040
Don't joke about this!

35:41.840 --> 35:43.360
Please don't scare me.

35:43.440 --> 35:45.440
When have I ever scared you?

35:46.400 --> 35:48.440
When have I ever joked with you?

35:48.520 --> 35:50.720
Come and take a look.

35:55.080 --> 35:57.240
I wondered why Lady Huan
stood here every day.

35:58.120 --> 36:01.240
As expected, the view from here

36:01.840 --> 36:03.440
truly is different from the rest.

36:11.880 --> 36:14.080
Free yet within bounds.

36:15.080 --> 36:16.640
If you wish to jump in, then go ahead.

36:18.120 --> 36:19.560
Why fear what others say?

36:27.880 --> 36:29.280
Or perhaps,

36:30.800 --> 36:32.160
you never intended to jump in at all.

36:36.280 --> 36:37.840
If that's the case,

36:40.040 --> 36:42.240
why not discuss a business deal with me?

37:05.240 --> 37:07.240
Speak your mind.

37:24.480 --> 37:26.520
Don't you want to be a songstress

37:28.360 --> 37:29.560
or win the top beauty title?

37:30.240 --> 37:31.080
Does it matter?

37:34.200 --> 37:36.400
Gaining brings no joy,
and losing brings no sorrow.

37:37.000 --> 37:40.240
Then what is it that you desire?

37:42.360 --> 37:44.480
And you? What do you desire?

37:51.560 --> 37:53.200
I came to Yangzhou after many close calls,

37:54.240 --> 37:56.080
simply wishing to establish myself here.

37:57.720 --> 37:59.240
I'm not like you.

38:00.560 --> 38:02.160
What I seek

38:03.480 --> 38:05.080
is to find a devoted heart

38:06.320 --> 38:07.720
and never part till we grow old.

38:10.920 --> 38:13.440
So, that's the reason you wish to retire?

38:14.080 --> 38:16.200
But if you retire like this,

38:16.280 --> 38:18.280
will those who once supported you

38:19.280 --> 38:21.240
let you go so easily?

38:23.760 --> 38:25.520
The Huan family promoted me

38:26.120 --> 38:28.160
merely to be a living sign
for their jewelry shops.

38:28.240 --> 38:30.160
Those noble sons lifted me up

38:30.680 --> 38:33.240
just because they liked my pipa's tune.

38:33.320 --> 38:35.960
When Bai Niao used cheap tricks
to win over me,

38:37.280 --> 38:38.440
they suddenly decided

38:38.520 --> 38:40.800
Bai Niao's pipa playing
was the true melody of heaven.

38:45.440 --> 38:47.480
This world is full of filth,

38:48.000 --> 38:50.360
and I'm merely a puppet on strings.

38:50.960 --> 38:51.960
Only he…

38:52.480 --> 38:54.080
he promised to marry me.

38:54.160 --> 38:56.240
He treats me differently

38:57.840 --> 38:58.880
from everyone else.

38:58.960 --> 39:00.440
If he's so good,

39:03.040 --> 39:04.320
why hasn't he married you?

39:07.040 --> 39:08.520
He has his own hardships.

39:08.600 --> 39:10.080
But I trust him.

39:11.360 --> 39:12.560
I believe

39:15.320 --> 39:16.720
he will fulfill his promise.

39:21.880 --> 39:23.320
And after you retire?

39:23.840 --> 39:25.840
How do you plan to live?

39:27.680 --> 39:29.560
I can do more than play the pipa.

39:29.640 --> 39:31.840
I know my way around the kitchen, too.

39:31.920 --> 39:35.320
At worst, I'll sell off the jewels
to support myself.

39:36.480 --> 39:38.760
Living off savings
eventually leads to running out.

39:40.360 --> 39:42.640
Would you like to have your own business

39:44.080 --> 39:45.720
here in Yangzhou?

39:45.800 --> 39:48.520
This way, you won't need to bow to others.

39:48.600 --> 39:50.880
And even if one day you wish to retire

39:51.400 --> 39:52.960
and live an ordinary life,

39:54.160 --> 39:55.280
you'll have a place to shelter you.

40:04.120 --> 40:06.680
If you rely only on the lover
in your heart,

40:09.360 --> 40:12.840
all is well in deep affection,

40:14.760 --> 40:16.080
but once feelings fade,

40:17.480 --> 40:18.640
you'll be as strangers.

40:19.520 --> 40:23.080
Without a fallback plan,
you'll end up hurt in the end.

40:33.160 --> 40:36.560
Perhaps what you say is right.

40:39.000 --> 40:40.280
Lady Huan,

40:44.200 --> 40:45.720
I can help you win the top beauty title.

40:46.320 --> 40:49.200
In this Qionghua Festival,
I am but a supporting role.

40:49.720 --> 40:51.280
You want to help me win
the top beauty title?

40:55.120 --> 40:56.520
Not me helping you,

40:58.280 --> 40:59.560
but rather you helping me.

41:00.760 --> 41:02.560
With your pipa skills,

41:03.400 --> 41:05.640
paired with the craftsmanship
of Clear Mind,

41:14.880 --> 41:16.560
you will find it interesting.

41:27.760 --> 41:31.040
ROSEWOOD, SANDALWOOD

41:32.800 --> 41:34.280
Clear Mind?

41:35.360 --> 41:37.280
I've never heard of it. Where is it?

41:37.920 --> 41:39.160
It doesn't yet exist.

41:39.840 --> 41:43.080
Actually, Clear Mind
is the reason I came to see you.

41:43.160 --> 41:44.760
You want to open a shop in Yangzhou?

41:48.920 --> 41:50.040
What is your name?

41:51.360 --> 41:52.360
Su Muzhe.

41:54.560 --> 41:56.320
Su Muzhe…

42:06.440 --> 42:10.080
The Qionghua Festival is dull,
but you are intriguing.

42:13.480 --> 42:15.320
I might just play along with you.
